%% 健身示例：徒手深蹲。没写踝角度，ground on + feet flat 让脚掌一直平贴地面
motion
title 徒手深蹲（示例）
group 健身 Fitness
tempo 30
length 4
ground on
feet flat
ease snap
view side
note 两拍蹲下、两拍站起；膝盖跟脚尖同向

beat 1 : 站直，脚与肩同宽，核心收紧
  root pitch=4
  spine 0
  head 0
  hip both=4/12/22
  knee both=2
  shoulder both=4/10
  elbow both=12
  hand both=soft
  muscle glmax=0.2 quad=0.25
  label quad.L
beat 3 : 臀部向后坐，大腿接近水平，背保持中立
  root pitch=40
  spine -10
  head -24
  hip both=124/16/22
  knee both=116
  shoulder both=118/6
  elbow both=4
  hand both=flat
  muscle glmax=0.95 quad=0.95
  label glmax.L
